---

<section id="book-call" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-stone-100/70 dark:bg-stone-900/40 relative">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center relative z-10">
    <div class="p-8 sm:p-14 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-950 via-stone-900 to-stone-950 border border-stone-800 shadow-2xl text-white relative overflow-hidden">
      <!-- Background Ambient Glow -->
      <div class="absolute -top-24 -left-24 w-72 h-72 bg-amber-500/20 blur-[90px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-24 -right-24 w-72 h-72 bg-amber-500/20 blur-[90px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/30 mb-6">
        Free 30-Minute Growth Strategy Call
      </span>

      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-tight mb-6">
        Ready to Scale Your E-Commerce Brand to the Next Level?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10">
        Join 40+ e-commerce brand founders who’ve trusted HBA to scale their sales. Whether you’re stuck at $10K/month or aiming for ₹1Cr+, we’ll get you there with expert ads management, viral creatives, and influencer marketing—all done for you.
      </p>

      <!-- Primary CTA Button -->
      <div class="mb-6">
        <a
          href="#book-modal"
          class="open-booking-modal inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 sm:py-5 rounded-xl text-base sm:text-xl font-bold bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-stone-950 shadow-xl shadow-amber-500/25 hover:shadow-amber-500/40 hover:scale-[1.03] active:scale-[0.98] transition-all group"
        >
          <span>Book Your Free Growth Strategy Call Now!</span>
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 ml-3 group-hover:translate-x-1.5 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Subtext Guarantee -->
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-stone-400 max-w-xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
        </svg>
        By the end of this call, you’ll have a clear roadmap to 3X your sales in 90 days—100% free, no strings attached.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
